n from this idea\n01  Agree the outcome\n02  Name the owner\n03  Set the next checkpoint\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n06\nThe decision\n1 source · current\nAdd slide\nEdit\nOverview\nCompare\n01\nCreate a six-slide decision review for a fictional sourcing pilot\nverified\nSLIDE JOB\nIllustrative pilot only. Review 100 → 120 → 140 units; reference 00123 remains text. Decision: prototype after checking the budget. 中文交接 — no external claims.\nCreate an editable, reviewable presentation from this idea\nOPENING / 01\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n01\n1 / 6\nPresenter notes\n25 words\n65%\nFit\nINSPECTOR\nSelection · none\nAI\nDesign\nNodeBook\nComments\nVersions\nEvidence\nJSON\nTrace\nCONTEXT\nRead context · locked write scope\nSlide 01 · Create a six-slide decision review for a fictional sourcing pilot\n\nScoped context by default; explicit @ references are additive.\n\nNODESLIDE\nWhat should we change?\n\nDescribe the outcome. I’ll return a scoped, validated patch for review before anything changes.\n\nDeck CI\nPassed\n0 blockers · 0 warnings\nGenerate 3 directions\nSharpen the story\nReduce density\nWhole slide\nKimi K3\nKimi K3 · Moonshot AI · Recommended\nGLM 5.2 · Z.ai · OpenRouter\nClaude Sonnet 5 · Anthropic · OpenRouter\nClaude Fable 5 · Anthropic · OpenRouter\nGemini 3.5 Flash · Google · OpenRouter\nGemini 3.1 Pro · Google · OpenRouter\nGPT-5.6 Sol · OpenAI · OpenRouter\nGPT-5.6 Terra · OpenAI · OpenRouter\nDeterministic · no external model\nHigh\nLight\nHigh\nUltra\nScoped\nStructure, presentation, and cleanup checks passed",
